+## Why
+
+The booking desk has no way to rent out boards and sails. The school needs a basic rental module to price and book equipment by the day.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add an in-memory rental service, created with `createRentalService()` and exported from `src/index.ts`.
+- `addEquipment` registers an item (`id`, `kind` of `board` or `sail`, `dailyPrice` in euro cents).
+- `quote` prices a rental period; `book` reserves the item for it and returns a booking with an id.
+- Both reject unknown items and periods that are not whole UTC days; `book` also rejects overlaps on the same item.
+- The cancellation policy (no refund less than 24 hours before start, otherwise full refund) is recorded as a rule of the module. Cancelling is **not** implemented in this change.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `equipment-rental`: equipment registration, quoting and booking of rentals by whole UTC days.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+- New code in `src/` (the repository has none yet); no runtime dependencies.
+- Establishes the money, time and cancellation rules that later work (cancellations) builds on.
